00:03:57.732 --> 00:04:00.276
Hey, squirrel, why don't you take it from here?

00:04:00.276 --> 00:04:02.237
Oh, I couldn't possibly.

00:04:02.237 --> 00:04:05.490
♪ We are young, we run green ♪

00:04:05.490 --> 00:04:08.535
